<%# IMPLEMENTED: dual_auth minigame (MG-11).
    Two PIN keypads side by side — IT Security (Ravi Anand) left, Clinical Engineering (David Osei) right.
    On correct PIN entry (either side): sets itsec_authorised=true or clinical_eng_authorised=true.
    AUTHORISE button activates only when BOTH sides show AUTHORISED.
    On AUTHORISE: sets network_isolation_authorised=true and network_isolated=true (triggers NPC cascade).
    5-minute countdown timer: on timeout, sets dual_auth_failed=true and closes with complete(false).
    PLAYER FLOW: get itsec_pin from Ravi (IT Office) → get clinical_pin from David (this room,
